# Added here: Blessed Arm (322), The Black Shield (1319, 1320), Highperch Venom (1135), Hardened Shells (1105),
# Load Lightening (1176), A Bump in the Road (1175), Fiora Longears (1132).
# Fizzle offers Martek the Exiled (1106) once Salt Flat Venom and Hardened Shells are both handed in: taken here, for the
# Badlands at the end of 30-40 (Indurium, 1108), and News for Fizzle (1137) back at the Raceway in 40-50/04.
# Since 2026-11-07 the Mirage Raceway and Dustwallow Marsh's Shady Rest quests are done here, on one crossing to
# Theramore (the Raceway was a crossing of its own at 30 in 07-thousand-needles). The Missing Diplomat's Dustwallow
# part (36-38) and Swamplight Manor stay in 40-50/01.

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

