  zone Wetlands
  tip Red Jack Flint stands on the dock just north of the flight master.
  accept 1132                         -- For Fiora Longears on Theramore's docks, where this guide's boat lands

step Glorin Steelbrow
  zone Wetlands
  tip Glorin stands on the upper floor of Menethil's keep.
  turnin 270                          -- Inside
  accept 321

step Deepwater Tavern
  tip Tapoke Jahn (34) slips out of the tavern once you take The Missing Diplomat: stay close behind him. He turns on you outside, a friend joins him, and he gives up once badly hurt. If you lose him the quest fails: abandon it and take it again from Mikhail.
  sethome "Deepwater Tavern"
  turnin 1248                         -- Mikhail
  accept 1249
  kill 4962 quest 1249 @10.5,60.3 map 1437 -- Tapoke "Slim" Jahn
  turnin 1249
  accept 1250                         -- Tapoke "Slim" Jahn
  turnin 1301                         -- Vincent Hyal
  accept 1302
  turnin 1250                         -- Mikhail
  accept 1264

step Waterlogged Chest
  tip The wreck of the Flying Osprey lies in the shallows south of the keep.
  turnin 321
  accept 324

