step The Shady Rest Inn
  tip Follow the road west out of Theramore to the burned inn on the road toward the Barrens: the black shield lies in the ashes and the hoofprints are in the mud beside the inn.
  accept 1284 @29.7,47.6              -- Hoofprints
  accept 1253                         -- Black Shield

