step Mirage Raceway: kill these as you meet them
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers and Salt Flats Scavengers roam the north half, Sparkleshell Snappers (tortoises) the whole flats. Saltstone Basilisks and Crystalhides hold the middle; the Gazers (34-35) only the far south.
  collect 5794 quest 1104                 -- Salty Scorpid Venom
  collect 5798 quest 1110                 -- Rocket Car Parts
  collect 5848 quest 1176                 -- Hollow Vulture Bone
  collect 5795 quest 1105                 -- Hardened Tortoise Shell
  kill 4147 quest 1175.1                  -- Saltstone Basilisk
  kill 4151 quest 1175.2                  -- Saltstone Crystalhide
  kill 4150 quest 1175.3                  -- Saltstone Gazer
  collect 5675 quest 1078.1 optional      -- Crystalized Scale, from the Saltstone Basilisks: eight for Collin Mauren in Stormwind

